Description: Screenshot and annotation tool (PyQt6 port)
 ksnip-pyqt6 is a modern Python/PyQt6 port of the ksnip screenshot and
 annotation application. It provides a complete screenshot capture
 and annotation workflow with support for multiple capture modes,
 extensive annotation tools, OCR text recognition, and upload
 capabilities.
 .
 Features:
  * Multiple capture modes: rectangular area, full screen, current screen,
    active window, window under cursor, and xdg-desktop-portal (Wayland)
  * Rich annotation tools: pen, marker, arrows, shapes, text, numbers,
    blur, pixelate, crop, stickers, watermarks
  * OCR text recognition via PaddleOCR (optional)
  * Image upload via configurable scripts
  * Multi-language support with 41 translations
  * System tray integration with single-instance support
  * High-DPI and dark/light theme support